WEBVTT
Language: hi-Latn

00:00:07.042 --> 00:00:09.624
<v Gopal>Ji sir, main Gopal bol raha hoon.

00:00:09.624 --> 00:00:11.189
<v Gopal>Mere naam se parcel?

00:00:11.189 --> 00:00:12.206
<v Gopal>Usmein drugs?

00:00:12.206 --> 00:00:15.335
<v Gopal>Sir, maine kabhi koi parcel nahin bheja.

00:00:15.625 --> 00:00:16.372
<v Gopal>Giraftaar?

00:00:16.372 --> 00:00:18.239
<v Gopal>Abhi, isi video call par?

00:00:18.239 --> 00:00:20.777
<v Gopal>Sir, main ek retired teacher hoon.

00:00:20.777 --> 00:00:23.018
<v Gopal>Paise kis khaate mein bhejoon?

00:00:23.333 --> 00:00:23.676
<v Ira>Papa?

00:00:23.676 --> 00:00:25.528
<v Ira>Kisko paise bhej rahe hain?

00:00:25.528 --> 00:00:28.203
<v Ira>Ek minute ke liye phone neeche rakhiye.

00:00:28.203 --> 00:00:29.163
<v Ira>Bas ek minute.

00:00:29.458 --> 00:00:30.745
<v Gopal>Police hai, beta.

00:00:30.745 --> 00:00:31.881
<v Gopal>Digital arrest.

00:00:31.881 --> 00:00:36.802
<v Gopal>Keh rahe hain camera ke saamne
baithe raho aur kisi ko mat batao.

00:00:37.083 --> 00:00:39.245
<v Ira>Aisa kuchh hota hi nahin, papa.

00:00:39.245 --> 00:00:45.173
<v Ira>Police, CBI, customs, judge, koi bhi video
call par giraftaar nahin karta. Koi nahin.

00:00:45.458 --> 00:00:47.373
<v Gopal>Par usne vardi pahni thi.

00:00:47.373 --> 00:00:48.446
<v Gopal>Badge bhi tha.

00:00:48.446 --> 00:00:52.277
<v Gopal>Peechhe jhande lage the,
bilkul asli thaane jaisa.

00:00:52.583 --> 00:00:54.751
<v Ira>Vardi koi bhi khareed sakta hai.

00:00:54.751 --> 00:00:58.341
<v Ira>Wo thaana ek mez ke peechhe
paint ki hui deevaar hai.

00:00:58.341 --> 00:00:59.628
<v Ira>Call kaatiye, papa.

00:00:59.917 --> 00:01:04.047
<v Gopal>Do ghante se yahan baitha
paseene mein bheeg raha hoon.

00:01:04.047 --> 00:01:06.601
<v Gopal>Tumhaari maa ko bhi nahin bataaya.

00:01:06.917 --> 00:01:12.407
<v Ira>Yahi to chaal hai. Dar, jaldbaazi, aur
kisi ko mat bataana. Koi paisa gaya kya?

00:01:12.708 --> 00:01:17.292
<v Gopal>Ek rupaya bhi nahin. Tum aayin,
tab main passbook dhoondh raha tha.

00:01:17.583 --> 00:01:18.242
<v Ira>Badhiya.

00:01:18.242 --> 00:01:22.605
<v Ira>Ab wo number sancharsaathi.gov.in
par report karenge,

00:01:22.605 --> 00:01:25.156
<v Ira>taaki wo kisi aur ko na daraye.

00:01:25.458 --> 00:01:27.975
<v Gopal>Aur agar paise chale jaate to?

00:01:28.292 --> 00:01:33.608
<v Ira>To turant 1930, cyber crime
helpline, ya cybercrime.gov.in.

00:01:33.608 --> 00:01:37.843
<v Ira>Jitni jaldi, paisa rukne
ki utni zyaada ummeed.

00:01:38.125 --> 00:01:45.032
<v Gopal>Video call par koi giraftaari nahin. 1930.
Aaj raat poori society ko bataata hoon.
